    "type": "game",
    "name": "Revive The Town!",
    "steam_appid": 3573190,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Summer vacation is coming, and due to your mother's work, you and her come to a remote town together to establish a communication base station.</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The name of the town is The Hot Spring Town, but due to its remote location and lack of internet access, there are not many people in the town anymore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this simple town, you will meet all kinds of people and experience different stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to obtain funds through activities such as insect catching, fishing, flower picking, bird watching, while enjoying rural life. Use the funds to purchase small town stalls, attract customers, rebuild convenience stores and other shops, and hire staff; After the establishment of the internet, using social media to take beautiful pictures to attract migrant workers; Maintain town roads, road management, etc Start the plan to revitalize the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Attention: Due to version changes, the image materials used in this instruction are not the latest version of the game. The game graphics are based on the screenshot assets! (The image assets described in this description will be updated synchronously in the near future)</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/c3592ca80768c74967733f2e46e39b87.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use WASD to move and space to jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/5519f0a6d3560d169faec917b3f8328b.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regarding the camera: This game is essentially a 3D game, but playing from a horizontal perspective can provide the best experience* Some specific activities, such as cooking, will be conducted from a first person perspective.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make good use of tools to fish, catch insects, and farm freely in the small town, and earn income to buy fun things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/114ee8a60d0479839d39cdb91d9f37fd.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/b7ebe4290db10cc7aa7e9211c9615998.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>The loot obtained is divided into white, green, blue, and gold levels, with higher value for rarer items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/a7c2cbb50de51f33c32b40d4ea64e50c.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check your catalog, there are captured collectibles inside!\uff08waiting for translation....\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/c8d1b45530ca43a09020def693ac387f.avif?t=1755019894\" width=800 height=572 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone loves fishing and farming.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/104cc141ea328b82b248e68c2e188e8a.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can entrust the mayor to take you on a car tour of the town (similar to a fast trip) and have the player control the car themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/71404d23095fa3d031c26226dfc0db25.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>if you have internet, you can upload a beauty map to social media, get a comment and attention to the good news, make more exotic population travel to the town, and it is likely to get more town income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/b196b4d5ab6105ae468e18d6b3bdac76.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>A sea view room of your own! Love comes from the residents of Hot Spring Town!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/74ca7eb777baac63b605beb8039f4f91.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you feel tired, you can also spend time at home and improve your character's attributes by resting and relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a cup of green tea every day to enhance your character's insight points! Insight points can be used to observe potential development opportunities in small towns and establish new buildings!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/826703678808fec341530e94b774b478.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can donate your money to establish and develop the town, and the town's income will also be returned to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/0c48846bfa94fe422fec7623fa417c33.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Managing your residence and placing treasures can enhance various outputs of the town, and even change some gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/808b730818ff4368f56c72e3057e4e1b.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the game, need to pay attention to your physical strength and thirst level, which can be supplemented by consuming food and drinks. Otherwise, you can only go home early to rest!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/bafae10e62f2efd550af53535baa9ac8.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Vending machine, waiting for translation....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/cd9933a9b54182db7d61f46b20381319.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Go meet new friends! Solve their problems, and become good friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/ce9cf2ea87ef6ac781978d47c94e91af.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Fishing with friends.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/3734cee01919fda8bbda78db34cd4c87.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/e3dba93ca7f160c0a2a3f920fd5c51fd.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping at Tanaka's sushi restaurant *(this part is from a first person perspective)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/c5f21b218a271ce34fee1e4d8437cbd9.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/5105e21bb4c74e5c42053fb8bc65b857.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/ad304b95832dc507fe39f2006889928e.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your small supermarket well...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/acac1d4f9bef82cb9cb79e3c5092cc4f.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend a grand gathering with friends\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is under continuous development....</p>",
