paragraph\" >You can entrust the mayor to take you on a car tour of the town (similar to a fast trip) and have the player control the car themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/71404d23095fa3d031c26226dfc0db25.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>if you have internet, you can upload a beauty map to social media, get a comment and attention to the good news, make more exotic population travel to the town, and it is likely to get more town income.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/b196b4d5ab6105ae468e18d6b3bdac76.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>A sea view room of your own! Love comes from the residents of Hot Spring Town!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/74ca7eb777baac63b605beb8039f4f91.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you feel tired, you can also spend time at home and improve your character's attributes by resting and relaxing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a cup of green tea every day to enhance your character's insight points! Insight points can be used to observe potential development opportunities in small towns and establish new buildings!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/826703678808fec341530e94b774b478.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can donate your money to establish and develop the town, and the town's income will also be returned to you!</p><p class=