ght=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/e3dba93ca7f160c0a2a3f920fd5c51fd.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helping at Tanaka's sushi restaurant *(this part is from a first person perspective)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/c5f21b218a271ce34fee1e4d8437cbd9.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/5105e21bb4c74e5c42053fb8bc65b857.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/ad304b95832dc507fe39f2006889928e.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your small supermarket well...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573190/extras/acac1d4f9bef82cb9cb79e3c5092cc4f.avif?t=1755019894\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend a grand gathering with friends\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is under continuous development....</p>",
